WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.334
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.834
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:06.033
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.534
Republicans yesterday
elected Mike Johnson

00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:10.868
the 56th Speaker of the House,

00:00:10.868 --> 00:00:12.801
which is crazy
because a month ago,

00:00:12.801 --> 00:00:14.467
we were only at 12.

00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:16.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:18.434
Politico published
a new profile today

00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:20.200
about House speaker
Mike Johnson, titled

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.300
"55 Things You Need to Know
About Mike Johnson."

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.667
55?!

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:28.167
I don't know 55 things
about my wife.

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:29.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:33.167
I don't think there are
55 things about Mike Johnson.

00:00:33.167 --> 00:00:37.234
What's number 55 on the list?
He's not allergic to cilantro?

00:00:37.234 --> 00:00:39.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:41.601
Workers at the Capitol yesterday
hung a sign

00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:44.434
above the speaker's office
for House Speaker Mike Johnson,

00:00:44.434 --> 00:00:47.267
instead of what Johnson wanted
to hang in the Capitol building,

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:48.234
Mike Pence.

00:00:48.234 --> 00:00:52.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:56.100
Judge Arthur Engoron
fined former president

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:59.367
Trump $10,000 yesterday
for violating his gag order.

00:00:59.367 --> 00:01:00.601
Said Trump, "Here's 20.

00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:02.534
I just posted
your address on Instagram."

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:04.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:07.234
The United Auto Workers
announced yesterday

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:10.467
that the union has reached
a tentative agreement with Ford.

00:01:10.467 --> 00:01:13.901
Though Ford still hasn't managed
to reach a deal with Calvin.

00:01:13.901 --> 00:01:18.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:21.167
Authorities in Orlando
recently arrested a man

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:22.834
who allegedly
robbed a pharmacy

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:24.801
and demanded bottles
of prescription drugs,

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:26.000
including Viagra.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.367
The robber didn't have a weapon,
but now he does.

00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:33.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:37.167
Italian Prime Minister Giorgia
Meloni announced yesterday

00:01:37.167 --> 00:01:40.033
that she has split
from her boyfriend of a decade

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.334
after an audio
recording surfaced of him

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:45.968
inviting a woman
to join him in group sex.

00:01:45.968 --> 00:01:47.834
And he would have
gotten away with it, too,

00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:49.367
if he hadn't identified himself.

00:01:49.367 --> 00:01:51.334
-It's a-me, Mario.

00:01:51.334 --> 00:01:58.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.100 --> 00:01:59.601
-You know, every now
and then we get criticized

00:01:59.601 --> 00:02:01.501
for not doing stories
about international news,

00:02:01.501 --> 00:02:03.300
but I think we have
a very nuanced take.

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:06.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.868 --> 00:02:09.167
KFC unveiled two new wraps
this week,

00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:11.868
including a fried chicken
and mac and cheese option.

00:02:11.868 --> 00:02:14.968
And if you eat them both, you
can get a third wrap for free.

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:20.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.667 --> 00:02:22.334
And finally, in honor
of Halloween,

00:02:22.334 --> 00:02:25.534
select Chipotle locations
will stay open until midnight.

00:02:25.534 --> 00:02:29.434
And to make it extra scary,
the bathroom closes at 10.

00:02:29.434 --> 00:02:31.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.434 --> 00:02:33.167
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:02:33.167 --> 00:02:39.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:42.734
Before we move on tonight,
I just want to say something.

00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:44.367
As you no doubt know by now,

00:02:44.367 --> 00:02:46.501
there was yet another mass
shooting last night,

00:02:46.501 --> 00:02:49.300
this time in the town
of Lewiston, Maine.

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:51.767
On this show, we make jokes
about everything --

00:02:51.767 --> 00:02:53.701
human stupidity,
governmental chaos.

00:02:53.701 --> 00:02:55.200
We even make jokes about evil.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:58.467
But it is exceedingly difficult
to find a way to talk

00:02:58.467 --> 00:03:01.601
about tragedy in the face
of events like these.

00:03:01.601 --> 00:03:06.234
You really come right up
against the impotence of words.

00:03:06.234 --> 00:03:07.868
All I can say
is we are deeply saddened

00:03:07.868 --> 00:03:11.601
by the loss of life in Lewiston
and the loss of life in Israel

00:03:11.601 --> 00:03:14.501
and Gaza and Ukraine
and countless other places.

00:03:14.501 --> 00:03:17.734
We continue to wish for peace
for every community

00:03:17.734 --> 00:03:19.400
living under the constant
threat of violence,

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:22.801
which tragically seems
to be every community,

00:03:22.801 --> 00:03:25.400
we're going to try to move on
and have a good time tonight.

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:27.634
But thank you so much
for hearing me out.

